<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />

    <title>CASA NATURAL</title>

    <style>

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }
.hero {
  width: 100vw;
  height: 100vh;

  background-image: url('/hero.jpg.png');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center center;
  background-attachment: scroll;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {

  .hero {

    background-image: url('/hero-mobile.png');

    height: 100svh;

    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;

  }

 

}

    

    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <section class="hero"></section>
<section style="
  background:url('/textura.png'),
  #F5F1EA;;
  background-size: 700px;

background-repeat: repeat;
position:relative;

overflow:hidden;

box-shadow:
  inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4),
  inset 0 -40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  padding:140px 30px;
  text-align:center;
"><div style="
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;

  background:
    radial-gradient(
      ellipse at top left,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.035),
      transparent 55%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      ellipse at bottom right,
      rgba(0,0,0,0.03),
      transparent 60%
    );

  pointer-events:none;
"></div>

  <p style="
    max-width:700px;
margin:auto;
color:#2E2A27;

font-family:'Courier New', monospace;

font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.4rem);

line-height:2;

letter-spacing:0.06em;

text-align:center;

opacity:0.96;

font-weight:normal;

text-shadow:0 0 0.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);

filter:contrast(0.95);
  ">

    Creemos en los rituales cotidianos.<br /><br />

    En las casas donde todavía fermentan cosas.<br /><br />

    En el olor del pan, las hojas
    y el jabón secándose lentamente.

  </p>

</section>
<section style="
  background:#F5F1EA;
  padding:120px 0 140px 0;
">

  <div style="
    width:88%;
    margin:auto;
  ">

    <img
      src="/cocina.png"
      style="
        width:100%;
        display:block;
      "
    />

  </div>

  <div style="
    max-width:700px;
    margin:70px auto 0 auto;
    text-align:center;
    padding:0 30px;
  ">

    <div style="
  font-family:'Courier New', monospace;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:0.18em;
  font-size:0.82rem;
  color:#5A4E45;
  margin-bottom:18px;
  font-weight:600;
">
  LA COCINA
</div>

    <p style="
      font-family:Georgia, serif;
      color:#2E2A27;
      font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2.3rem);
      line-height:1.5;
      margin-bottom:26px;
    ">

      Una introducción tranquila al mundo
      de la masa madre.

    </p>

    <p style="
      font-family:'Courier New', monospace;
      color:#5E534B;
      font-size:1rem;
      line-height:1.8;
      max-width:700px;
      margin:auto;
      opacity:0.9;
    ">

      Un vídeo para aprender a crearla desde cero,
      entender sus ritmos y empezar
      a convivir con ella.

    </p>

    <div style="
      margin-top:46px;
    ">

      <a
        href="#"
        style="
          border:1px solid rgba(60,50,40,0.25);
          padding:18px 34px;
          text-decoration:none;
          color:#2E2A27;

          font-family:'Courier New', monospace;
          text-transform:uppercase;
          letter-spacing:0.16em;
          font-size:0.72rem;

          transition:0.3s ease;

          display:inline-block;
        "
      >
        Entrar en la cocina
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
<section style="
  background:#EFE7DC;
  padding:120px 0 140px 0;
">

  <div style="
    width:90%;
    margin:auto;
  ">

    <img
      src="/patio.png"
      style="
        width:100%;
        display:block;
      "
    />

  </div>

  <div style="
    max-width:760px;
    margin:70px auto 0 auto;
    text-align:center;
    padding:0 30px;
  ">

    <div style="
      font-family:'Courier New', monospace;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:0.18em;
      font-size:0.75rem;
      color:#7A6E63;
      margin-bottom:30px;
    ">
      EL PATIO
    </div>

    <p style="
      font-family:Georgia, serif;
      color:#2E2A27;
      font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.4vw,2.7rem);
      line-height:1.5;
      margin-bottom:40px;
    ">

      Los meses también tienen olor.

    </p>

    <div style="
      font-family:'Courier New', monospace;
      color:#4A4038;
      line-height:2;
      letter-spacing:0.04em;
      font-size:1rem;
      opacity:1;
    ">

      JULIO · albahaca · limón · piedra caliente
      <br />

      AGOSTO · hoja de higuera · leche tibia · sombra fresca
      <br />

      SEPTIEMBRE · tierra húmeda · mosto · aire frío

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
 <section style="
  background-image:url('/footer-textura.png');
  background-size:cover;
  background-position:center;

  padding:0;

  height:500px;
">
</section>
 </body>
 
</html>